  "description": "The 27.5\"+ Maniacc Flyer is a wheelie lover’s dream. The Maniacc Flyer’s 6061 aluminum Floval tubing frame and Cr-Mo Landing Gear forks are built for serious action and provide an awesome look. This bike has been upgraded this year with a Tektro hydraulic disc brake, giving you total confidence in stopping power. Rolling on huge 27.5\" x 3.0\" Speedster tires, the Maniacc Flyer is all about stability, speed, and traction. It's also equipped with Wheelie Pegs for when you want to bust a move. The new SE Captive seat provides unmatched hold and comfort, and the flangeless Mushroom Wing grips give you a great feel and endless lever mounting options. This bike doesn't just make a statement—it IS the statement!",
